# Allocation: the evidence the recording of the allocated trade cannot give. The request, the call and the outcome
# are the shared steps of api/trade_lifecycle_event.snippet.

# ── Assertions ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# The trades the allocation created, retrieved: their notionals are the requested split.
@Then "^the allocated trades carry the requested notional amounts$"
    Then the new trades of the event have 'data.trade.basic.notionalAmount' as in the request's 'notionalAmounts'
